{"type":"standard","title":"Eric Barlow","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Eric Barlow</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q16147585","titles":{"canonical":"Eric_Barlow","normalized":"Eric Barlow","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Eric Barlow</span></span>"},"pageid":41327797,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375514802","tid":"b2374ff1-b32f-11f1-9ffd-eb14ed9e2cd9","timestamp":"2026-09-18T07:08:06Z","description":"American politician (born 1966)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Barlow","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Barlow?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Barlow?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Eric_Barlow"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Barlow","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Eric_Barlow","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Barlow?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Eric_Barlow"}},"extract":"Eric Barlow is an American politician currently serving as a Republican member of the Wyoming Senate since 2023. He previously served as the speaker of the Wyoming House of Representatives from 2021 to 2023 and as a member of the chamber representing District 3 from 2013 to 2023.","extract_html":"<p><b>Eric Barlow</b> is an American politician currently serving as a Republican member of the Wyoming Senate since 2023. He previously served as the speaker of the Wyoming House of Representatives from 2021 to 2023 and as a member of the chamber representing District 3 from 2013 to 2023.</p>"}